@startuml
autonumber
title Napari Lab Mode Sequence (producer + subscriber)

actor User
participant "napari.lab.main" as Lab
participant "subprocess\nheadless.main" as Producer
participant "TCP endpoint" as TCP
participant "napari.subscriber" as Sub

User -> Lab : main(argv)
Lab -> Producer : Popen(headless bootstrap, --viz tcp ...)
Lab -> Lab : wait_for_tcp_endpoint(...)
Producer -> TCP : open/serve frames
Lab -> Sub : run_napari_subscriber(host, port, ...)
Sub -> TCP : poll/recv frames
Sub --> User : live read-only visualization

@enduml
